    <p class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-2">
      On 15 January 2026, Tabitha Quibble and Percival Snodgrass committed retail theft at Selfridges. Snodgrass assaulted a guard during flight. Both were apprehended within 15 minutes; all property was recovered.
