      <div id="overview-expanded-all" hidden>
        <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-top-3">At approximately 14:20, Tabitha Quibble and Percival Snodgrass entered Selfridges on the High Street. Quibble selected five items of clothing while Snodgrass assisted. Both concealed the items in their personal bags.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">At approximately 14:28, security guard M. Bumble observed their conduct and moved to confront them as they approached the exit. Snodgrass pushed Bumble forcefully, causing her to fall and sustain injury to her arm and shoulder. Both defendants fled the store but were apprehended by police within 15 minutes.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">All stolen items were recovered in good condition.</p>

